        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Eliiyaah Oo U Cararay Xoreeb",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasaa Axaab wuxuu Yesebeel u sheegay kulli wixii Eliiyaah sameeyey oo dhan, iyo siduu nebiyadii oo dhan seef ugu laayay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Yesebeel farriin u dirtay Eliiyaah oo ku tidhi, Sidaas iyo si ka sii daranba ilaahyadu ha igu sameeyeen haddaanan berrito hadda oo kale naftaada ka dhigin sidii mid iyaga ka mid ah naftiisii. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna markuu saas ogaaday ayuu kacay oo naftiisii la cararay, oo wuxuu yimid Bi'ir Shebac oo dalka Yahuudah ka mid ahaa, markaasuu midiidinkiisii halkaas kaga tegey. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse isagii intii maalin socodkeed ah ayuu cidlada sii dhex maray, oo intuu meel yimid ayuu hoos fadhiistay geed rotem la yidhaahdo; oo wuxuu weyddiistay inuu dhinto, oo yidhi, Rabbiyow, haatan waabase naftayda iga qaad, waayo, anigu kama aan fiicni awowayaashay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu jiifsaday, oo hoos seexday geed rotem ah, kolkaasaa waxaa taabtay malaa'ig, oo waxay ku tidhi, Toos oo wax cun. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kolkaasuu wax fiiriyey oo wuxuu arkay kibis dhuxul lagu dubay iyo kusad biyo ah oo madaxiisa yaal. Markaasuu wax cunay oo wax cabbay oo haddana wuu iska jiifsaday. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa malaa'igtii Rabbigii mar labaad u timid, oo intay taabatay ayay ku tidhi, Toos oo wax cun, maxaa yeelay, sodcaalku waa kugu dheer yahay. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu toosay, oo wax cunay, oo wax cabbay, oo cuntadaas itaalkeedii ayuu ku socday afartan maalmood iyo afartan habeen ilaa uu gaadhay Xoreeb oo ahayd buurtii Ilaah. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo intuu halkaas yimid ayuu god iska galay, oo halkaasuu baryay, oo bal eeg, waxaa isagii u yimid Eraygii Rabbiga, oo wuxuu ku yidhi, Eliiyaah, maxaad halkan ka samaynaysaa?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Rabbiga Oo U Muuqday Eliiyaah",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isna wuxuu yidhi, Anigu Rabbiga ah Ilaaha ciidammada aawadiis ayaan aad ugu hinaasay; waayo, dadkii Israa'iil axdigaagii way ka tageen, oo meelahaagii allabarigana way dumiyeen, oo nebiyadaadiina seef bay ku laayeen; oo aniga keligay ayaa ka hadhay, oo waxay doonayaan inay naftayda iga qaadaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna wuxuu ku yidhi, Ka bax, oo buurta fuul oo Rabbiga hortiisa istaag. Oo bal eeg, waxaa meeshaas soo maray Rabbiga, oo hortiisa ayaa dabayl weyn oo xoog badan buurihii kala jejebisay, dhagxantiina burburisay; laakiinse Rabbigu kuma jirin dabaysha; oo dabayshii dabadeedna waxaa jiray dhulgariir, oo Rabbiguna kuma jirin dhulgariirka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo dhulgariirkii dabadiisna waxaa jiray dab, laakiinse Rabbigu kuma jirin dabka, oo dabkii dabadiisna waxaa jiray cod yar oo gaaban. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markuu Eliiyaah taas maqlay, ayuu go'iisii wejiga ku duudduubtay oo dibadda u baxay, oo wuxuu istaagay meeshii godka laga soo geliyey. Oo bal eeg, markaasaa waxaa isagii u yimid cod leh, Eliiyaah, maxaad halkan ka samaynaysaa? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Isna wuxuu yidhi, Anigu Rabbiga ah Ilaaha ciidammada aawadiis ayaan aad ugu hinaasay, waayo, dadkii Israa'iil axdigaagii way ka tageen, oo meelahaagii allabarigana way dumiyeen, oo nebiyadaadiina seef bay ku laayeen; oo aniga keligay ayaa ka hadhay, oo waxay doonayaan inay naftayda iga qaadaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasaa Rabbigu wuxuu ku yidhi, Tag, oo ku noqo jidkaagii cidlada Dimishaq; oo markaad Dimishaq gaadhid waa inaad Xasaa'eel u boqortaa dalka Suuriya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo Yeehuu ina Nimshiina waxaad u boqortaa dalka Israa'iil; oo Eliishaa ina Shaafaad oo ah reer Aabeel Mehoolaahna waa inaad u subagtaa inuu meeshaadii nebi ka ahaado. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo markaasay waxay noqon doontaa in ninkii ka baxsada seefta Xasaa'eel uu Yeehuu dili doono; oo kii Yeehuu seeftiisa ka baxsadana waxaa dili doona Eliishaa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Laakiinse weliba waxaan daynayaa toddoba kun oo qof oo dalka Israa'iil ku jirta oo aan kulligood Bacal u jilbo joogsan oo aan midkoodna afkiisu Bacal dhunkan.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "U Yeedhistii Eliishaa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sidaas daraaddeed halkaas wuu ka tegey, oo wuxuu helay Eliishaa ina Shaafaad oo beer ku qodaya laba iyo toban qindi oo dibi ah ee ka horreeya isaga, oo isna wuxuu la jiray kii laba iyo tobnaad; markaasaa Eliiyaah isagii u soo gudbay oo go'iisii ayuu ku dul tuuray. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oo isna dibidii wuu ka tegey, markaasuu ka daba orday Eliiyaah oo ku yidhi, Waan ku baryayaaye aan soo dhunkado aabbahay iyo hooyaday, oo dabadeedna waan ku raacayaa. Markaasuu isna wuxuu ku yidhi, Haddana noqo, waayo, maxaan kugu sameeyey? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Markaasuu ka noqday isagii, oo wuxuu kaxeeyey qindigii dibida ahaa, wuuna qalay oo hilibkoodiina ku karshay alaabtii dibida, oo wuxuu siiyey dadkii, oo iyana way cuneen. Markaasuu kacay oo wuxuu raacay Eliiyaah, wuuna u adeegay isagii.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
